   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="news" subtype="handwritten">

            <head>
               <hi rend="allCaps">Zero Page by<name type="person" ref="#verna">Verna</name></hi>
            </head>

            <p>
               <hi rend="allCaps"> Touch down. The zero page. What is going on? Here? In town? You
                  tell me. Here's some "news": <hi rend="bold"><name type="band"
                        ref="#false_liberty">False Liberty</name></hi> needs a practice place,
                     <corr>preferrably</corr> one that is a low-rent pay-per-hour. If anyone knows
                  of a place they could practice, in the northend Seattle <del rend="scribble"><gap
                        reason="illegible"/></del> or just Seattle area, please contact me, <name
                     type="person" ref="#verna">Verna</name>, at 527-8834. Also, <name type="band"
                     ref="#false_liberty">False Liberty</name>
                  <del rend="scribble"><gap reason="illegible"/></del> is open to doing gigs around
                  the state. Please contact <hi rend="bold"><name type="person" ref="#greg"
                        >Greg</name> at 363-7485</hi> or <name type="person" ref="#mg">MG</name> at
                  the number above <del rend="scribble"><gap reason="illegible"/></del> if you're
                  doing a show or know someone who is <del rend="scribble"><gap reason="illegible"
                     /></del><add place="above">and</add> need(s) an inexpensive but excellant
                  opening band. <hi rend="bold"><name type="band" ref="#false_liberty">False
                        Liberty</name></hi> will also be touring this summer. If you would like them
                  to play in your town, call me at <hi rend="bold">(206)527-8834</hi> and we'll
                  talk, OK.? Cool.</hi>
            </p>
            <p>
               <hi rend="allCaps"><hi rend="bold"><name type="band" ref="#the_melvins">The
                        Melvins</name></hi>' album should be out soon, if it's not out already.</hi>
            </p>
            <p>
               <hi rend="allCaps"><hi rend="bold"><name type="band" ref="#skin_yard">Skin
                        Yard</name></hi>' has an album out. Most local stores should have it. I know
                     <name type="place" ref="#fallout">Fallout</name> does. </hi>
            </p>
            <p>
               <hi rend="allCaps"><hi rend="bold"><name type="zine" ref="#wig_out"
                     >WigOut</name>!</hi> is a happening 'zine put out by the folks in <hi
                     rend="bold"><name type="band" ref="#girl_trouble">Girl Trouble</name></hi>. The
                  only <corr>publication</corr> I know that had <hi rend="bold"><name type="band"
                        ref="#horseheads">Tex&amp;TheHorseheads</name></hi> on one page and a review
                  of an early 70's movie, <hi rend="bold">Cleopatra Jones</hi>, on another! Alright.
                  well put-together and hilarious. Write to: <name type="zine" ref="#wig_out">Wig
                     Out</name>! PO box 44633 Tacoma WA 98444 </hi>
            </p>
         </div>
